    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "96 Rathedmond Estate is a well-presented three-bedroom semi-detached home ideally located in this established and popular residential area. The property benefits from a welcoming front porch which leads into a fully carpeted entrance hall with carpeted stairs to the first floor. The ground floor \r\naccommodation includes a comfortable sitting room with carpet flooring and a feature fireplace with electric fire. To the rear of the property, the kitchen features tiled flooring, a fully fitted kitchen with tiled splashback and provides direct access to the rear garden. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms, all with carpet flooring, along with a shared family bathroom on this level. Externally, the property offers a tarmac driveway to the front providing private off-street parking, along with a gate and convenient side access running alongside the adjoining garage. To the rear, the home enjoys a mature south-facing garden, ideal for outdoor relaxation. The property is also within walking distance of Sligo town centre with its wide range of shops, restaurants and amenities, and is just a short walk from Sligo bus and train station. Viewing is highly recommended. To arrange a viewing, please contact Oates Breheny Group on 071-9140404."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION\r\nGROUND FLOOR\r\nEntrance Hall  \r\nCarpet flooring and stairs.\r\n\r\nSitting Room (3m x 4.31m) \r\nCarpet flooring. Feature fireplace, with back boiler.\r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining (5m x 3.69m) \r\nFully fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, electric oven/hob. Tiled flooring and splashback. Direct access to rear garden.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\nBedroom 1 (2m x 2.97m) \r\nCarpet flooring. Walk in closet.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (2.97m x 3.99m) \r\nDouble room. Carpet flooring. Walk in closet.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (3m x 3.24m) \r\nDouble room. Carpet flooring. Walk in closet.\r\n\r\nBathroom (1.97m x 1.64m)\r\nTiled floor to ceiling. WC & WHB. Electric shower.\r\n\r\nHotpress\r\nShelved storage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Double glazed windows.\r\nOil fired central heating.\r\nUnderstairs storage.\r\nTarmac driveway offering private off-street parking. \r\nMature south-facing garden.\r\nAdjoining garage with electric connection (2.5m x 5m)\r\nWithin walking distance of Sligo town centre.\r\nShort walk to Sligo bus and train station."
      },
      {
